#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:1
msgid "Putuo R&D Platform Projects, 2026"
msgstr "2026普陀科技研发平台项目"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:4
msgid "Grant | Putuo"
msgstr "补助｜普陀区"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:6
msgid "2026 call published; not confirmed open"
msgstr "2026通知已公布，未确认正在受理"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S111 "
"<https://www.shpt.gov.cn/zhengwu/kjptjs-kwkjcxnlts/2026/244/205993.html>`_. "
"关于开展2026年度普陀区科技研发平台项目申报工作的通知-上海普陀."
msgstr "`证据 S111 <https://www.shpt.gov.cn/zhengwu/kjptjs-kwkjcxnlts/2026/244/205993.html>`_. 关于开展2026年度普陀区科技研发平台项目申报工作的通知-上海普陀."

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:13
msgid ""
"Up to RMB 2 million; first payment at most 50%, balance subject to "
"acceptance"
msgstr "最高200万元，首期不超过50%，余款按验收情况拨付"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:15
msgid "No equity"
msgstr "不占股"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:20
msgid ""
"Lawfully established, good-credit legal or non-legal-person organizations "
"building qualifying R&D platforms. Online registration requires district "
"review; credit commitments and prescribed materials are required."
msgstr "依法设立、信用良好并建设合资格研发平台的法人或非法人组织；线上注册须区级审核，并提交信用承诺及规定材料。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:22
msgid "Confirm the deadline in the September 2026 notice"
msgstr "核验2026年9月通知中的具体截止日"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route "
"<https://kwxxh.shpt.gov.cn/v2/ptoa/#/user/register>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://kwxxh.shpt.gov.cn/v2/ptoa/#/user/register>`_"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:29
msgid "Published consultation: +86 21 52564588 ext. 8628."
msgstr "公布咨询电话：+86 21 52564588 ext. 8628。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../funding/putuo-rd-platform.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
